B.adX=s(["Track: prioritise rhythm in sector 2 and protect the rears\u2014this layout rewards clean exits.","Strategy: flex between one and two stops after FP2 degradation runs; undercut threat is real.","Weather: watch gusts on the longest straights and trim aero if crosswinds build.","Racecraft: take the inside into the first big braking zone; the next straight punishes poor exits.","Session plan: bank FP2 long runs first, then qualifying sims once the rubber is down."],t.s)
B.apq=s(["Track: Turns 3\u20134 reward a tidy exit\u2014Albert Park walls punish greedy throttle on the lakeside.","Strategy: two-stop Medium/Hard splits are common; safety cars can flip the order\u2014stay flexible.","Weather: cool changeable air off the bay\u2014grip can swing session to session.","Racecraft: DRS along Lakeside Drive\u2014set up the pass before the heavy braking into the stadium.","Session plan: treat FP2 as the tyre reference; traffic on short laps makes clean long runs gold."],t.s)
B.ahq=s(["Track: the \u201cSnail\u201d complex needs patience; the long back straight rewards a good traction exit.","Strategy: sprint weekend\u2014tyre allocation is tight; protect softs for SQ and race day.","Weather: spring Shanghai can throw rain\u2014watch spray on the long straight entries.","Racecraft: Turn 1 is wide\u2014defend inside but don\u2019t compromise the run to the back straight.","Session plan: sprint quali means fewer laps\u2014nail track evolution between SQ and race."],t.s)
B.adm=s(["Track: 130R and the Esses reward rhythm\u2014Suzuka is a flow circuit, not a point-and-squirt track.","Strategy: one-stop Medium/Hard often wins; pit loss is painful\u2014track position matters.","Weather: autumn Honshu can be wet\u2014intermediate timing around Degner is decisive.","Racecraft: Casio Triangle is the overtaking lottery\u2014brake late but leave room for cutback.","Session plan: tyre warm-up on low-grip mornings\u2014prioritise long runs in representative heat."],t.s)
B.aqZ=s(["Track: traction out of the final corner sets up the main straight\u2014rear stability is everything.","Strategy: desert night race\u2014two-stop is typical; watch undercuts when the field stacks.","Weather: cool evenings but sand on track\u2014front grip can vary lap to lap.","Racecraft: Turns 1 and 4 are the main lunges\u2014defend early, don\u2019t drift wide onto traction paint.","Session plan: FP2 mirrors race conditions\u2014long runs under lights are your tyre baseline."],t.s)
B.apR=s(["Track: blind entries and concrete\u2014commitment through the fast kinks is survival first.","Strategy: high degradation\u2014two stops common; safety car frequency can bunch the pack.","Weather: coastal humidity at night\u2014watch dew and changing rear grip.","Racecraft: few clean spots to pass\u2014set up at the chicanes, don\u2019t force walls.","Session plan: short practice\u2014every lap counts; avoid traffic in quali sims."],t.s)
B.amf=s(["Track: long corners and low grip off-line\u2014stay disciplined; the marina section punishes mistakes.","Strategy: heat and traction zones\u2014two-stop window often opens if SC appears.","Weather: Florida thunderstorms\u2014radar matters; inter timing around the long straights.","Racecraft: tight turns after long straights\u2014brake in a straight line, avoid front-lock off-line.","Session plan: track rubbers quickly\u2014qualifying sims late Friday matter more than early banker."],t.s)
B.ahf=s(["Track: Wall of Champions territory\u2014last chicane needs precision; don\u2019t chase kerbs too hard.","Strategy: stop-go circuit\u2014undercut on the long pit loss is powerful if traffic allows.","Weather: variable Montreal summers\u2014rain can arrive fast; grip on the hairpin changes.","Racecraft: Hairpin and Senna S are the moves\u2014brake late but protect the inside for the exit.","Session plan: kerb evolution shifts balance\u2014re-run quali trim after rubber builds."],t.s)
B.apY=s(["Track: no room for error\u2014every corner is a qualifying lap; rhythm beats heroics.","Strategy: track position > strategy\u2014overcut rarely beats on-track order in the Principality.","Weather: rare dry drama\u2014if rain hits, the harbour section becomes ice on slicks.","Racecraft: Tunnel exit and Nouvelle Chicane are ambush points\u2014mirror defence early.","Session plan: Thursday/Friday traffic jigsaw\u2014find clear quali sims before Saturday matters."],t.s)
B.aoR=s(["Track: sector 3 traction onto the main straight decides tow battles\u2014rear stability wins.","Strategy: tyre wear on front-left\u2014two-stop vs one-stop swings with track temp.","Weather: Catalan wind across the grid\u2014balance shifts corner to corner.","Racecraft: Turn 1 and the final complex are the lunges\u2014don\u2019t compromise the run to Campsa.","Session plan: representative heat in FP2\u2014morning sand on track can mislead long-run reads."],t.s)
B.aqg=s(["Track: short lap, big slipstream\u2014qualifying tow games and race DRS trains are real.","Strategy: soft tyre offset strategies appear\u2014pit lane is short, undercuts sting.","Weather: Alpine showers\u2014local cells can drench sector 1 while sector 3 stays dry.","Racecraft: Turns 3\u20134 and the final corner are dive zones\u2014defend before the climb.","Session plan: traffic on a 4.3 km lap\u2014book clean quali laps early in the window."],t.s)
B.alm=s(["Track: high-speed balance\u2014Copse, Maggots, Becketts reward commitment and a stable rear.","Strategy: tyre blistering in heat\u2014two-stop vs one-stop swings with asphalt temp.","Weather: Silverstone wind and showers\u2014full wets vs inters calls define weekends.","Racecraft: Hangar Straight DRS duels\u2014set the pass before Stowe, not through it.","Session plan: Friday gusts vs Saturday calm\u2014re-check aero balance before quali."],t.s)
B.ana=s(["Track: Eau Rouge\u2013Raidillon needs respect\u2014lift slightly if the rear is light; survival first.","Strategy: long lap, big pit loss\u2014undercut/ overcut chess; SC probability is high.","Weather: Ardennes microclimate\u2014one end of the track can be wet while the other is dry.","Racecraft: Les Combes and Bus Stop are passing zones\u2014brake straight, avoid kerb hop.","Session plan: FP2 long runs in mixed conditions can lie\u2014prioritise dry baseline if race dry."],t.s)
B.agZ=s(["Track: twisty Hungaroring\u2014sector 2 rhythm is everything; protect fronts in long corners.","Strategy: tough to overtake\u2014qualifying matters; one-stop vs two-stop hinges on traffic.","Weather: hot Budapest\u2014rear overheating in traffic; watch thermal degradation.","Racecraft: Turn 1 and chicane after the back straight\u2014defend inside, don\u2019t run wide.","Session plan: low-speed balance shifts with fuel\u2014run quali fuel levels in final practice."],t.s)
B.aqO=s(["Track: banking and wind\u2014Zandvoort is narrow; one mistake stacks a train behind you.","Strategy: bank stoppers struggle in traffic\u2014two-stop window if deg opens.","Weather: North Sea gusts\u2014coastal crosswinds into banking change balance lap to lap.","Racecraft: Tarzan and Hans Ernst are lunges\u2014late braking works if you keep rotation tight.","Session plan: orange smoke limits vision in quali\u2014pick a clear out-lap slot early."],t.s)
B.ad2=s(["Track: low drag, high speed\u2014Monza is slipstream chess; tow in quali can decide rows.","Strategy: one-stop vs two-stop swings with SC\u2014pit lane is short, packs stay tight.","Weather: late-summer storms\u2014sudden rain on the straights while Lesmo stays dry.","Racecraft: Rettifilo and della Roggia are the moves\u2014brake late but don\u2019t miss the apex.","Session plan: track limits at Ascari and Parabolica\u2014trim wing after FP1 baseline."],t.s)
B.anu=s(["Track: new hybrid layout\u2014prioritise learning references; walls and surface grip are unknown early.","Strategy: green track evolves fast\u2014two-stop flexibility until deg numbers stabilise.","Weather: Madrid heat and dust\u2014grip can jump once the line rubbers in.","Racecraft: unknown passing spots\u2014protect the inside on long straights until maps settle.","Session plan: every session is data\u2014short-run vs long-run split to map tyre crossover."],t.s)
B.aqL=s(["Track: long straights into 90\xb0\u2014Baku punishes lockups; castle section is walls both sides.","Strategy: SC likelihood\u2014split strategies appear; pit entry speed trap catches mistakes.","Weather: Caspian wind down the main straight\u2014braking zones lengthen with headwind.","Racecraft: Turn 1 and the castle chicane\u2014dive early or don\u2019t; no half moves.","Session plan: FP1 street dust vs night race rubber\u2014qualify on latest representative track."],t.s)
B.aoO=s(["Track: bumpy street, 23 corners\u2014mental load is high; front tyres take a beating.","Strategy: two-hour race, high deg\u2014two-stop baseline; safety cars bunch the field often.","Weather: tropical storms\u2014inter timing around the long straights decides podiums.","Racecraft: few clean spots\u2014set up at Raffles and the bay; avoid kerb hopping under brakes.","Session plan: night heat vs evening quali\u2014track evolution from FP2 to Q3 is huge."],t.s)
B.alK=s(["Track: esses through sector 1 need flow; rear stability sets up the long back straight.","Strategy: tyre deg on traction zones\u2014two-stop vs one-stop swings with asphalt temp.","Weather: Texas gusts and heat\u2014balance shifts; watch crosswind into the esses.","Racecraft: Turn 1 and the back straight hairpin\u2014late braking works if you keep rotation.","Session plan: bumpy Austin surface\u2014ride height and kerb usage evolve through weekend."],t.s)
B.aeq=s(["Track: thin air, long straights\u2014low drag; watch brake temps into the stadium section.","Strategy: altitude hurts cooling\u2014lift-and-coast can appear; strategy stacks around SC.","Weather: afternoon storms\u2014track can cool quickly; inter calls on the perimeter.","Racecraft: Turn 1 is wide\u2014three-wide risk; defend inside early for the esses.","Session plan: FP2 at altitude mirrors race\u2014fuel-correct long runs for deg truth."],t.s)
B.ark=s(["Track: Senna S and middle sector\u2014Interlagos needs mechanical grip and patience.","Strategy: sprint weekend possible\u2014tyre steps and SC history keep strategies open.","Weather: sudden rain in the hills\u2014rivers at Senna S when it pours.","Racecraft: Turn 1 and Pinheirinha\u2014cutback moves work if you leave a car width.","Session plan: altitude and bumps\u2014re-check quali trim after rubber builds in FP2."],t.s)
B.aq1=s(["Track: long straights, low grip off-line\u2014street walls; traction out of slow corners wins.","Strategy: cold night temps\u2014tyre warm-up laps matter; graining on long runs possible.","Weather: desert cold at night\u2014rear grip can surprise on the long strip.","Racecraft: few clean passes\u2014set up on the long braking zones; avoid wall contact.","Session plan: late sessions mirror race\u2014prioritise long runs when track temp matches."],t.s)
B.anp=s(["Track: high-speed corners stress fronts\u2014smooth inputs keep the tyres under you.","Strategy: abrasive surface\u2014two-stop common; pit lane loss vs deg is the trade.","Weather: desert wind and sand\u2014front grip varies; track limits are strict.","Racecraft: long straights into heavy braking\u2014tow and DRS trains decide moves.","Session plan: night conditions in FP2\u2014baseline long runs for Sunday temps."],t.s)
B.abJ=s(["Track: traction out of the hotel section sets the marina straights\u2014rear stability first.","Strategy: one-stop often wins\u2014track position and undercut threat around pit loss matter.","Weather: evening humidity\u2014dew can appear late race; grip can come up suddenly.","Racecraft: Turns 5\u20136 and the hotel chicane\u2014defend inside, avoid wide exits onto paint.","Session plan: twilight evolution\u2014qualifying after sunset can feel like a different track."],t.s)
